<div class="stats"><div class="stat"><span>Local MySQL</span><b>ONLINE</b><small>Operational source</small></div><div class="stat"><span>Cloud Sync</span><b><?=cfg('app.sync_enabled')?'ENABLED':'DISABLED'?></b><small>Outbound API only</small></div><div class="stat"><span>Outbox Pending</span><b><?=$pending?></b><small>Waiting to sync</small></div><div class="stat"><span>Conflicts</span><b><?=$conflicts?></b><small>Need resolution</small></div></div><div class="grid2"><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Offline Architecture</h2></div></div><div class="panel-body"><p style="font-size:11px;line-height:1.7">POS / Tablet / KDS → PHP Local App / Edge API → <b>aio_local MySQL</b> → Sync Outbox → Background Sync → HTTPS Cloud API → aio_cloud MySQL.</p><div class="flash ok">Cloud MySQL port 3306 should never be exposed publicly. The branch initiates outbound HTTPS sync only.</div></div></section><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Outbox</h2></div></div><div class="panel-body"><div class="table-wrap"><table class="table" style="min-width:480px"><thead><tr><th>Entity</th><th>Operation</th><th>Status</th><th>Created</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($outbox as $o):?><tr><td><?=e($o['entity_table'])?></td><td><?=e($o['operation_type'])?></td><td><span class="tag orange"><?=e($o['status'])?></span></td><td><?=e($o['created_at'])?></td></tr><?php endforeach;?></tbody></table></div></div></section></div>